@startuml
actor Researcher
boundary View
control KanbanController
control PhaseService
database SQLServer
Researcher->View: choose status
View->KanbanController: POST ChangeStatus
KanbanController->KanbanController: authorize
KanbanController->PhaseService: Change
PhaseService->SQLServer: Begin transaction
PhaseService->SQLServer: Update phase
PhaseService->SQLServer: Insert ActivityLog
PhaseService->SQLServer: Commit
KanbanController-->View: redirect
@enduml
